OL,3,GNEWSAParents warned to be on alert
OL,4,Aafter school data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have been told to be alert for
OL,7,Funexpected emails or phone calls after
OL,8,Fa Northern Ireland school app used by
OL,9,Falmost 50,000 people was affected by a
OL,10,Fdata breach.
OL,12,FThe Equipple app is used by many
OL,13,Fschools to schedule and book meetings
OL,14,Fbetween parents and teachers.
OL,16,FThere have been concerns that the
OL,17,Fbreach may have allowed access to
OL,18,Fparent contact details and some pupil
OL,19,Finformation.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
