OL,3,GNEWSAParents warned to be on alert
OL,4,Aafter school data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement to BBC News NI a
OL,7,Fspokesperson for Equipple said they
OL,8,Fwere taking the matter "extremely
OL,9,Fseriously" and that there is "no
OL,10,Fevidence of any ongoing unauthorised
OL,11,Faccess to the platform".
